            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EA highlights recap of Umbraco community meetups from 2025, covering both online sessions and hybrid events.\nFeaturing key moments from talks, discussions, and community interactions across the Umbraco ecosystem\u2014presented as a visual montage with background music.\n\nBuilt by the community. Powered by shared learning.\n\n#Umbraco #UmbracoCommunity #UmbracoCMS #DotNet #TechMeetup #DeveloperCommunity\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MV3xroHRHws\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
